								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >这是一款RPG刷宝冒险游戏，内容丰富，多职业多次转职和觉醒成长、门派势力选择、宠物培养、宝石镶嵌——构建专属的深渊冒险。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/c455dd19b1ae9e4f6abe8b4e954a0ddd.avif?t=1789371644" width=1088 height=590 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >几百种装备和独特道具自由搭配自由冒险，数百种技能机制各异玩法丰富，大量新的冒险地图等你来探索。</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >大量新创作的地图，冰天雪地，岩浆，森林，遗迹，墓园等</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >【游戏特色】</h2><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>1.技能机制各异玩法丰富</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >数百种专门开发的技能：主动/被动/召唤/变身大Boss/属性光环/阵法/自爆/盗宝等多种多样的技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >华丽的技能特效，实实在在的打击感</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >通过技能熟练度可以增加伤害甚至进化技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >盗宝技能可以多次触发物品和金币掉落，再也没有难掉落的装备</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >甚至可以召唤任何强大的Boss敌人为你而战，不仅仅是敌人，复制队友，释放分身，让战斗不再枯燥无味</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >敌人和我方都会学习觉醒技能，通过积累怒气释放</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >2.<strong>多阶职业转职系统</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >从基础职业，转职到中阶职业，再到高阶职业，最终进行觉醒，每一步都能实实在在提高角色的实力</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >还有一些强大的特殊职业等待发现</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >基础职业包括：异界人/战士/僧侣/士兵/猎人/魔法师等，有着不同的转职路线不同的装备类型</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>3.海量装备自由搭配</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >数百种装备，套装收集，装备技能提取，宠物魔变装备，随机强化，镶嵌，宝石合成等</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >刷怪收集套装获得强大的套装属性</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >独立的稀有装备有特殊的技能，可以变身强大的boss，华丽的元素光环，签订契约召唤敌人等</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >武器装备模式多样化，9大类武器，可以使用剑盾模式，二刀流，双手持的不同装备，在防御和输出之间取舍</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >4.<strong>深度角色成长</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >角色拥有多职业转职路线，每一条路线都有精心设计的技能和对应的打法</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >武器熟练度养成，通过不断使用武器和武器技能能够提高武器的熟练度，从而提高伤害和学会新的武器技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >技能熟练度培养</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>5.宠物系统</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >宠物同样可以从初阶进化到中阶，高阶，每一只宠物都是独一无二的</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >宠物捕获/进化/孵化可以获得大量的随机主动和被动技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >宠物有几率获得【变异】甚至非常稀有的【魔变】</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >宠物的合成和部位突变玩法非常灵活，可以培养出拥有大量装备部位的强大个体，攻守兼备</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >魔变的强大宠物培养之后可以转化成为魔变装备，拥有非常强大的属性和套装效果</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>6.门派系统</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >游戏分为五毒教、忍宗、魔法研究院、圣母神教会四个门派可以自由选择</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >不同门派拥有不同的技能和商店道具以及不同的玩法</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >五毒教：用毒，造成异常状态，召唤傀儡辅助战斗</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >忍宗：分身术，复制敌人，手里剑</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >魔法研究院：增强四元素魔法攻防，学习四元素顶级华丽技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >圣母神教会：光暗魔法，变身，封印敌人变身和光环</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >通过门派任务获得报酬提升门派等级，解锁更多商店和技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >7.<strong>世界Boss与副本挑战</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >打败实力强大的世界Boss和副本Boss可以获得稀有的装备/技能书/道具</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >探索不同副本的解锁机制，挑战更高难度的副本，增强掉落装备属性</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >副本难度越高，敌人属性越高，技能越多，掉落装备属性增强，掉宝率/经验值/金币获得增加</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >地狱难度的副本会出现新姿态的最终Boss，掉落更稀有的道具和装备</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>8.随机事件</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >【宠物秘境】会随机出现，可以捕获大量宠物，提高获得变异魔变宠物的机会，挑战boss和魔王获得进化道具</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【门派通缉令】击杀敌对门派势力Boss，掉落稀有物品和技能书，获得大量门派贡献</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【宝箱怪】掉落宝石，大量经验和金币等，捕获宝箱怪培养成为强大的魔王甚至可以成为队伍主力</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【武道会竞技】和各大门派的高手对决，有几率掉落各种珍稀道具和装备，体验4大门派独一无二的技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>9.强大独特的敌人</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >多种多样的副本Boss和世界Boss</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >变异和突变的敌人拥有更强大的属性，同时也有更高的报酬</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>10.详细的图鉴功能</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >【怪物图鉴】查询怪物技能，掉落和属性弱点等详细的数据</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【宠物图鉴】查看宠物捕获和进化过程中可以获得的所有技能组和专属技能</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【怪物雷达】显示当前地图的所有怪物和出现概率</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【技能图鉴】查看所有在战斗中使用过的技能详情，让战斗更加有针对性</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533490/extras_big/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >【状态图鉴】清楚看到每个状态的具体作用和时长</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>11.天气系统</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >游戏中有多种不同的天气，提供不同的元素和属性加成，部分技能可以改变天气</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >还分为白天和黑夜，部分地图事件和特殊敌人在夜间出现，掉落更稀有的装备</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>〖 开发者寄语 〗</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" > <br>目前大多数功能已经实现，但由于工作量较大，剩余部分还在加速开发中</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >正在实现的功能：</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >1.剧情：更多的主线任务，更多的支线任务以及门派任务</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >2.更多职业：后续会开发更多特殊职业，比如</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>魔剑士</strong>（暗属性吸血技能，魔法和物理双修）</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>死灵术士</strong>（封印死亡敌人召唤为我军战斗单位）</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>剑圣</strong>（三刀流装备3把武器，更强大的剑术技能）</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>驱魔师</strong>（召唤敌人，强化召唤物，大量召唤）</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >为二次转职增加更多分支选择</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >3.世界Boss：</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >掉落各种特殊装备和道具，增强队伍实力</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >宠物魔化，突破等级，选择物攻/法攻/护卫/治疗不同形态</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >4.新地图：70级以上地图和怪物，更多强大且具备特色的装备</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >5.新的功能：</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >无限增强的爬塔模式，怪物和掉落装备都会一直增强</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
